UINDOSILL LICENSING
===================

Two licences apply to this project, and which one governs a copy depends on
whether that copy carries the video player.

    The source code in this repository is MIT-licensed (part A below).

    A BUILD THAT VENDORS libmpv IS DISTRIBUTED UNDER THE GNU GENERAL PUBLIC
    LICENSE, VERSION 2 OR LATER (part B below), because libmpv and the FFmpeg
    libraries linked into it are GPL, and the GPL governs the combined work.

A build that has not vendored libmpv contains no GPL component and is MIT
throughout. Whether a given copy did is visible in the application's About
window — Settings, then About Uindosill, then the Licences pane — which lists
libmpv only when it is present. The full text of the GPL, version 2, is
in licences/GPL-2.0.txt. See docs/LICENSING.md for what each obliges, and
licences/mpv-WRITTEN-OFFER.txt for where the corresponding source lives.

The model weights are covered by neither. They are separately licensed by their
authors (CC BY 4.0, the NVIDIA Open Model License, and Apache-2.0), they are
downloaded by the user rather than distributed with the application, and their
notices are in NOTICE.md.


